      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The §3Flare Stack§r is a generator that produces energy by burning flammable liquids and gases. Any fluid tagged as Flammable can serve as fuel - supply it through pipes or directly via containers.\n\nOperation uses three steps. First, fill the internal buffer (capacity: §e64,000 mB§r) with fuel. Second, open the §6Flow Valve§r at the top of the middle section to release fuel from the buffer into the combustion system. Third, enable the §6Ignition§r switch at the bottom of the middle section to ignite the fuel and begin power generation.\n\nEfficiency is low: gases burn at §e50%§r and liquids at only §e10%§r. Output also varies by fuel type.\n\nTwo upgrades are available: the §6Speed Upgrade§r increases throughput, and the §6Effectiveness Upgrade§r improves fuel efficiency.",
